WEBVTT

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:58.220
For a minute, I thought I wouldn't
make it back to Japan alive.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.640
I've risked my life on this journey.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:04.980
And this is the pot you risked
your life to get, Ogi?

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.940
Is there something in it?

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:08.150
Nectar.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.540
Nectar?

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.600
What kind?

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.800
Listen, Sugio.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.060
I got this nectar from a tribe I met.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:19.360
They extract it from a 
peculiar kind of plant,

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:24.170
and they seemed to worship that plant.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:28.330
This nectar tastes so good, it's as if 
it's imbued with the power of the gods.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.960
It's that good, huh?

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.010
So sweet!

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:40.580
It's unbelievable!

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.340
Wanna try some?

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.630
Sure, I'll have a taste.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:49.860
But first, I need to warn you not 
to be noticed when you eat it.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.320
Don't be noticed?

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:53.670
By who?

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.300
The nectar god?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.070
Well, something like that.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:04.660
They were adamant about it, though.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.790
Don't be noticed, they said.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.070
It's good!

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:20.890
Hey, Ogi, are you home?

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.170
Kameda, what are you doing?

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:25.020
Don't worry about it.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.430
Hey, the window's open.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:32.550
Hey, that's not cool, Kameda.

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.480
He won't mind.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:38.800
That's it.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.700
Let's have a taste of that famous
nectar while the master is out.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.010
Just a taste, you guys.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.450
Ogi will be pissed.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:48.820
Who cares what he says?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.170
Yum!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.850
This is great, guys!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.130
Have a taste!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.810
You're right!

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:03.730
There's nothing I can compare 
it to, but it's delicious!

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.060
What is this?

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.340
It's great!

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:08.800
Delicious!

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:12.330
Just one taste isn't enough!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.780
Let's eat all of it!

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:15.450
We shouldn't.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.240
What about Ogi?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.640
It's no fair for him to 
keep it all for himself.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.430
Before we discuss that...

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:24.810
Do you smell something?

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:28.280
Yeah, like something's rotting.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.790
Is it coming from this room?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.760
Hey... What is this?

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.420
I don't know,

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.100
but let's get out of here.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.140
Hey, you've got more, Kameda!

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:59.980
No, I don't!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:05.050
Yum! That's so good!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:09.160
What part of South America did 
he get this delicious nectar from?

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.590
Dunno.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.910
I doubt even Ogi knows.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.700
What just happened?

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:24.360
I-It's Yasumin...

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.510
L-Look...

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:32.670
Wh-Why is Yasumin completely flat?!

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:33.970
Let's call the police!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.190
No!

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.740
That'll just make more problems!

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:38.540
Then what do we do?!

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.730
This is my room!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.340
How did this happen?

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.770
We're having a dream.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:48.450
This can't be real.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.000
That's right.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.540
It has to be a dream. It's impossible.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:56.440
So is this nectar a dream, too?

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.130
I'd be sad if this weren't real.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.500
R-Riruko...

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.970
It happened to Riruko, too!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.820
It's the nectar.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.160
If we eat it, we'll be flattened!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:14.790
Th-That doesn't make any sense.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.560
We all ate it!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:20.400
Is the same thing gonna happen to us?

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.860
Ogi said...

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:28.370
not to be noticed when
you eat the nectar.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:32.370
He said the tribe told him that.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:39.380
It's no use. It tastes so bad, I can't eat it.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.830
Me, neither.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.480
Since I ate that nectar,

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.800
everything else tastes terrible.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:47.640
Yeah...

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:52.290
The nectar may have
destroyed our sense of taste.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.340
Also...

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.350
Have you seen the news?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:00.880
They've found other flattened bodies
besides Riruko and Yasumin.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.830
I thought one might be Kame-chan,

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:04.260
but it wasn't.

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:07.570
A few of his friends have died, though.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:10.960
They must have eaten his nectar.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:15.010
He must have gotten scared
and given away the nectar.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.320
Long time no see, guys.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:19.970
Kameda.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.430
You guys have lost weight.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:26.180
You can't eat the food here, right?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.630
If only we hadn't eaten this nectar...

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.970
This nectar is the only thing
that tastes good to us.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.300
But that one thing is 
too dangerous to eat!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:39.760
The problem is how to eat it 
without being noticed.

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:45.010
I've tested a few different ways

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.450
of being noticed and not being noticed.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:52.180
Tested? What do you mean?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.910
I mean, they kept wanting more.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.860
So did you find a way?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:09.920
No, I gave away the nectar
and still have no idea.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.570
Oh, that's it!

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:12.880
I can't stand it anymore!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.290
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.730
It's so good!

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.440
Damn it! I'm having some, too!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.740
So good...

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.060
I saw it.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.310
Saw what?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:44.000
I saw some giant thing crush Sugio!

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:49.820
Yes, something crushed him!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.290
Why didn't I realize it before?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.720
We just can't let it crush us!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.800
Watch!

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:58.930
Yue!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:03.890
See? I'll be fine in the water!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.360
So good!

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.990
Sugio's wallet.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:25.610
A map.

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:36.090
<i>This map from his wallet...</i>

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:40.700
<i>It must lead to the source of the nectar.</i>

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.610
Damn, there are so many mosquitoes...

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.990
What kind of plant is this?

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:59.780
Huh? One of its branches just disappeared.

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:02.980
Now it's back.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.410
What's up with this tree?

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:09.790
This tree smells like the nectar.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.220
Of course!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.420
This tree makes that nectar!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.500
Yahoo!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:18.720
Nectar!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:32.060
<b>Smashed</b>

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:32.060
Collection No. 116

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:38.300
<i>Ohtsuka-kun is the target
of the girls' affection.</i>

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.590
<i>We became an item.</i>

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:44.330
<i>I got the cold shoulder from the 
other girls, but I was still happy.</i>

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.470
<i>But then, last week,</i>

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:50.250
<i>Ohtsuka-kun was hospitalized 
with mysterious abdominal pain.</i>

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.210
<i>And now...</i>

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.790
What a good idea!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.780
Look!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.220
I've got fangs!

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:13.390
Hey, what are you talking about?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.450
<i>She ignored me...</i>

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.320
Hey, Souichi!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.910
Is it true you deliver newspapers?

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.460
Couldn't be!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:24.960
What? Why?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.760
Oh, darn!

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.470
Who told you?

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.180
Huh?

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.370
It's true?

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.850
Have you heard?

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:35.940
Souichi joined an adult
baseball team as a pinch hitter

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.600
and hit a home run!

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.360
Hey, listen!

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:44.560
I heard Souichi-kun helped an old lady 
he didn't know cross the street yesterday.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:49.900
Hey, hey, big news!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.520
What? What is it?

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.830
Wait 'til you hear this!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:59.220
Souichi-kun's cousin is Kagawa
Kentarou from the Smogs!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.320
<b>Class 6-1</b>

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.320
An autograph, eh?

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.640
Don't tease us!

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:06.940
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.820
Get him to sign it as a favor to his cousin.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.970
Oh, darn!

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.260
How did you find out?

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:17.540
I was trying to keep that
stuff about Kentarou a secret!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.400
Oh, well.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.600
Okay, then.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.510
I'll get autographs for all of you.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.630
I love you, Souichi-kun!

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.480
You're so generous!

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:36.520
They love me, do they?

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.410
They sure changed their tune quickly.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:42.510
I've got a good idea.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:45.780
I'll say I could only get one autograph

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:50.410
and make them fight tooth and nail for it!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:57.210
Collection No. 071

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:57.210
<b>Rumors</b>

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:00.380
<b>Hospital</b>

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:59.530
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:02.070
<i>I brought flowers,</i>

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.180
<i>but what if he laughs at me?</i>

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:07.100
<i>But I'm going anyway.</i>

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.470
Ohtsuka 
Hironobu

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.480
Hello!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:13.350
Oh, Sakiyama!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:14.810
You came to see me.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.960
Ohtsuka-kun!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.110
Midori-san.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:23.870
Madoka-san, you came, too?

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:26.650
I was just passing by.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:30.340
You didn't need to, either of you.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:32.200
Are you feeling better?

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.700
Yeah, a lot better.

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:39.430
It doesn't hurt at night as much as before.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.230
I'll be discharged soon.

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.070
Good.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:43.290
More importantly...

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:48.810
Did you hear Souichi saved 
a kid from being hit by a car?

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:53.310
The principal was really impressed.

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:56.810
<i>Souichi-kun had become a hero.</i>

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:01.340
<i>But I was thinking more about Madoka-san.</i>

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:05.740
<i>I wondered if she liked Ohtsuka-kun.</i>

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:13.000
I heard Sakiyama Midori from Class 6-1...

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.420
likes Souichi!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:24.010
I heard Sakiyama Midori
from Class 6-1 likes Souichi!

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:31.140
Sakiyama Midori from Class 6-1 loves Souichi!

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.890
Love, love! Love, love!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.600
<b>Class 6-1</b>

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.830
Hey, guys, big news!

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.580
Sakiyama and Souichi are a couple!

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.520
Really?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.420
A hero and a heroine.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.400
They're a perfect couple.

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:50.600
Hold on a minute!

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:51.990
That's a lie!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.960
Listen, everyone.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:57.310
Souichi-kun started that rumor himself!

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:01.680
I saw him talking to some
girls behind the school

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:05.200
in a low voice that they could still hear.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:10.700
He must have made up all those
good rumors about himself, too.

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:14.000
<i>Crap. Oh, crap.</i>

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.210
Fangs!

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.720
What? Is that true?

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:23.850
So you're not Kagawa 
Kentarou's cousin, either?

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.900
Well? Well?

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:32.220
It's not nice to make up lies about people.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:34.780
I've got the autograph right...

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:41.750
<b>Smogs 
Kagawa Kentasetsu</b>

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.650
here!

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:38.880
What is this? The writing is terrible!

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.750
It doesn't look anything like
the autograph in the magazine.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.580
Well, it makes sense.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:49.170
There's no way he's related
to someone famous.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.460
Hey, where'd Souichi go?

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.310
He's running away.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:59.700
<i>A few days after that happened...</i>

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:05.110
<i>A bizarre photograph was
put up in our classroom.</i>

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.850
What is that?

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.980
It looks like it was cut out 
of a magazine, but it's...

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.420
Her face is so scary.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.950
I know what it is!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:19.830
What's with you? Don't yell like that!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.160
It was in a fashion
magazine my mom bought.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.850
You've gotta be kidding.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:30.550
Hydrating color for spring

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:29.070
There's no fashion model as creepy as that.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.500
It's a lipstick ad, right?

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.060
She's a highly respected fashion model!

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:37.490
My sister slept for a
week after seeing this.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.610
Hurry up and tear it down!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:46.020
<i>The strange rumors
started a few days later.</i>

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.660
Three or so fourth graders 
were heading home from school,

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.700
when <i>it</i> appeared...

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.390
It was dark, so they didn't get a good look,

00:16:57.390 --> 00:17:00.600
but they say it was a very tall woman.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:05.500
She stood there in the middle of the 
dark road without saying a word.

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:08.350
When they turned to go back the other way,

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:11.530
she spoke to them.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.720
What did she say?

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:16.210
"Am I beautiful?"

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:22.580
Their eyes adjusted to the darkness,
and eventually they could see her.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.560
But her face...

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.240
They got scared and tried to run.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:32.030
But the woman chased them!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.200
Her hair was waving,
she was running so fast!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:40.280
She yelled, "I'll catch you and eat you!"

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:45.490
The woman in that rumor sure sounds
like the one in that photograph.

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:47.290
The woman in the photo?

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:51.200
You know, the one that was 
stuck to the blackboard.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.500
That creepy woman?

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:58.130
It sounds like she really is a model.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:03.770
Someone said she's going to the 
Maiden's Abyss at the edge of town.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.140
Why?

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.960
Soaking in that swamp is
supposed to make you beautiful.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.720
It's famous all over.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:17.320
It seems a lot of you are upset about some
strange rumors that are spreading.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:21.240
There is no truth to them whatsoever.
Please do not be deceived.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.560
Moving on, we have a 
happy announcement!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.510
After a long stay in the hospital,

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:29.250
Ohtsuka-kun has returned!

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.170
Thank you.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:40.270
The school seems a lot brighter
with Ohtsuka-kun back.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:41.210
You're right.

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:44.410
I don't even care about monsters anymore.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.400
Yeah.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:48.600
By the way, did you hear the 
rumor about Madoka-san?

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.360
No, what rumor?

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:56.080
Someone said she soaked in 
the mud of the Maiden's Abyss.

00:18:56.080 --> 00:19:00.440
There's a rumor saying it 
makes you beautiful, right?

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.870
Look at her.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:06.740
She's been standing
there for a while, right?

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:10.630
Can you tell how eagerly
she's watching Ohtsuka-kun?

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.410
What will you do, Midori-chan?

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:16.710
If you don't make a move,
she's gonna take Ohtsuka-kun.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.020
<i>That surprised me.</i>

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:41.610
<i>But I have to do this,</i>

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.340
<i>if it'll make me beautiful.</i>

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.880
It worked! It worked!

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.920
S-Souichi-kun!

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.300
What are you doing here?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.420
I followed you.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:03.640
You waded into the swamp, 
just like I expected!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.550
You loach-girl!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.310
From the monster on the road

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:11.110
to Taniyama Madoka wading in the swamp...

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:14.310
They were all lies I made up!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:18.150
That magazine clipping
was surprisingly effective!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.930
Snap. Snap. Snap.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:21.510
W-Wait, stop!

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.180
Don't take pictures of me!

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.310
No way I'll stop!

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:25.610
I'm gonna tell the whole school

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:29.250
how you came out here
to wade into the swamp.

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.810
It's payback for you embarrassing me!

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:34.250
Stop it, you pervert!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.090
I won't stop!

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:44.020
What the heck? A bunch of 
birds all took flight at once.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.980
You there.

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:14.540
Who gave you permission
to take my picture?

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:18.710
How did you know I was here?

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:21.760
What publisher sent you?

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.920
I'm a professional
fashion model, after all.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:31.470
Do you know what happens to people who 
take my picture without permission?

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:37.640
All right, I'll show you.

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:44.060
You look so tender and delicious.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.090
<i>Coincidences are terrifying.</i>

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:54.880
<i>That model really was in town.</i>

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:58.040
<i>What happened to Souichi-kun?</i>

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.540
Wh-What a creepy...

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:05.070
beautiful lady...
